        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "Product",
        "category": "RealEstate",
        "description": "Perfectly sited on a quiet lane minutes from Greenwich Avenue, this 2024 SBP home offers serenity on nearly 5.5 gated acres. Walls of glass flood the interiors with natural light, highlighting 7'' white oak floors, a dramatic foyer, Calacatta marble fireplaces and Bocci lighting across 11,000+ sq ft. The open plan features a Bulthaup kitchen, living room with bar, and main-level bedroom suite or office with seamless indoor-outdoor flow. Upstairs are five en-suite bedrooms, including a luxe primary suite with dual dressing rooms and spa bath. Resort-style amenities include pool, spa, outdoor kitchen, fireplace, tennis court and two-bedroom guest house, plus finished lower level with media room, rec space, bar, wine cellar, gym and additional en-suite bedroom, elevator and three-car garage.",
